{"id":97262361158655,"name":"Combat Tower Obby [Abyss of Pain]","desc":"An obby game inspired by Tower of Hell, but here, instead of climbing up, you jump down and have access to weapons and items to sabotage and troll other players.\n\nDive into the ultimate Roblox obby challenge where you race downward through insane obstacles! Reach the bottom of the tower before the clock runs out. \nEngage in battles with other players as you descend, testing your reflexes and strategy against both the environment and human enemies.\n\nPlot your course, there are multiple paths you can take to get to the bottom floor.\nEarn coins and gems to buy items & weapons to knock opponents down, sabotage their progress, and be the first to reach the bottom. \nDodge traps, fight enemies, and master crazy jumps in the chaotic descent.\n\nThe tower is randomly generated, with obby stages of different difficulty ranging from easy to hard to impossible.\n\nEscape the Abyss to earn rewards and buffs to troll other players.\n\nBe sure to like 👍 and favourite ⭐ for new obby stages and updates.","path":"/game/97262361158655-combat-tower-obby","slug":"97262361158655-combat-tower-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/f7566d4f8fd0e7d2252cf6d82cf08a8f3531960c73c2e60054f5be81b44ce8a3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a8976bfb67fba0dd261060fd3ed2aceb/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":252523,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T16:07:16.360Z","creator":{"name":"B.R.G. Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Combat-Tower-Obby-Abyss-of-Pain-Abyss-of-Pain-Script-244219","_id":"6a5cf63401bb9253c403c3a9","title":"Abyss of Pain Script","game":{"_id":"6a5cf63401bb9253c403c3a8","gameId":97262361158655,"name":"Combat Tower Obby [Abyss of Pain]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me